=== Lattice Basics Demo ===

Lattice with 'bad' basis:
  b1: (10.000, 1.000), norm = 10.0499
  b2: (11.000, 2.000), norm = 11.1803
  Determinant: 9.0000

Finding short vectors (naive enumeration)...
  Shortest found: (1.000, 1.000), norm = 1.4142
  (Much shorter than basis vectors!)

Closest Vector Problem:
  Target: (4.700, 2.300), norm = 5.2326
  Closest lattice point: (0.000, 0.000), norm = 0.0000
  Distance: 5.2326
